The library carries no H.264 or H.265 codec: FFmpeg and OpenH264, which
LiveKit's own prebuilt links, are not built into it, and the build fails if any
of their symbols is found. It still carries the VP8, VP9 and AV1 video codecs
(libvpx, libaom and dav1d), which are royalty free, although the apps send
and receive no video. The libwebrtc District AI for Windows links is that
repository's own build, and its NOTICE lists it.

